{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"registry_group","type":"group","x":1160,"y":440,"width":1480,"height":960,"label":"Predefined Agent Registry"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Athena Multi-Agent Architecture v2\n\nNo Human-in-the-Loop. Planner decisions are executed automatically.","x":-1430,"y":-880,"width":760,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"user","type":"text","text":"User Query","x":-1540,"y":-430,"width":240,"height":80},
		{"id":"context","type":"text","text":"Context Builder\n- current user message\n- chat history\n- system / Athena instructions\n- available agent registry","x":-1160,"y":-480,"width":360,"height":180},
		{"id":"comprehend","type":"text","text":"Comprehend Node\nClassify request into:\n1. General\n2. Out of Scope\n3. Scoped / Complex","x":-700,"y":-480,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"general","type":"text","text":"General Node\nLLM-generated direct response","x":60,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"outscope","type":"text","text":"Out of Scope Node\nStatic / policy response\nNo specialist execution","x":60,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":130,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"planner","type":"text","text":"Planner Node\n\n- LLM structured output\n- decompose request into tasks\n- select predefined agent for each task\n- define dependencies\n- decide parallel vs sequential execution\n- set task priority / objective\n- automatic execution; no approval pause","x":0,"y":-390,"width":470,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"principles","type":"text","text":"## Architecture Principles\n\n1. No Human-in-the-Loop in current implementation.\n2. Planner is autonomous: plan → execute.\n3. Agent registry is predefined, not dynamically created.\n4. Each agent owns its domain prompt and connected tools.\n5. Parallel execution is controlled by dependency-aware waves.\n6. Wave Barrier is the single next-wave synchronization point.\n7. Agent failures are isolated, retried, and recorded.\n8. Synthesizer produces the final user-facing answer from execution evidence.","x":-1300,"y":-1360,"width":520,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"task_graph","type":"text","text":"Execution Plan / Task Graph\n\nTask = { task_id, objective, agent_id, dependencies, status }\n\nOnly predefined agents may be selected.","x":620,"y":-350,"width":430,"height":220},
		{
			"id":"4a854b63aaa88264",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## questions\n\n1. Need set of questions from the management to test the prompts. \n2. Need to get the data right in place. \n\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":460,
			"width":620,
			"height":460
		},
		{"id":"retry","type":"text","text":"Failure / Retry Control\nAgent tool failure → retry within agent limit\nPersistent failure → mark task failed\nPlanner / scheduler may continue with independent tasks and record partial completion","x":2340,"y":-980,"width":430,"height":180},
		{"id":"wave","type":"text","text":"Wave Scheduler\nFind all ready tasks whose dependencies are satisfied.\nDispatch ready tasks in parallel.","x":1195,"y":-300,"width":360,"height":170},
		{"id":"barrier","type":"text","text":"Wave Barrier\nSingle synchronization point after every parallel wave.\nPrevents duplicate next-wave dispatch.","x":2320,"y":80,"width":380,"height":170},
		{"id":"ledger","type":"text","text":"Execution Ledger / State\n- task status\n- outputs\n- failures\n- retry count\n- dependency completion\n- tool results\n- agent execution metadata","x":2750,"y":-360,"width":390,"height":310},
		{"id":"product","type":"text","text":"Product Agent\nDomain prompt + Product tools","x":1320,"y":530,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"response","type":"text","text":"Response to User","x":4080,"y":-430,"width":260,"height":100},
		{"id":"end","type":"text","text":"End","x":4420,"y":-420,"width":180,"height":80},
		{"id":"finance","type":"text","text":"Finance Agent\nDomain prompt + Finance tools","x":1630,"y":530,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"operations","type":"text","text":"Operations Agent\nDomain prompt + Operations tools","x":1340,"y":730,"width":270,"height":125,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"fallback_tools","type":"text","text":"Fallback Tools\nOnly approved generic capabilities","x":1630,"y":1150,"width":220,"height":100},
		{"id":"product_tools","type":"text","text":"Product Tools\nRAG / APIs / enterprise sources","x":1245,"y":1000,"width":220,"height":100},
		{"id":"ops_tools","type":"text","text":"Operations Tools\nRAG / APIs / enterprise sources","x":1255,"y":1150,"width":220,"height":100},
		{"id":"agent_runtime","type":"text","text":"Common Agent Runtime Pattern\n\nStart → Agent Model → tool needed?\n\nNo → return result\nYes → call connected tool → observe result → continue reasoning\n\nPer-agent controls:\n- scoped prompt\n- scoped tools\n- tool-failure retry\n- execution timeout / failure state","x":2220,"y":630,"width":390,"height":370},
		{"id":"hr","type":"text","text":"HR Agent\nDomain prompt + HR tools","x":1920,"y":530,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"finance_tools","type":"text","text":"Finance Tools\nRAG / APIs / enterprise sources","x":1630,"y":1020,"width":220,"height":100},
		{"id":"hr_tools","type":"text","text":"HR Tools\nRAG / APIs / enterprise sources","x":1890,"y":1020,"width":220,"height":100},
		{"id":"fallback","type":"text","text":"Fallback Agent\nHandles unmatched / generic scoped tasks\nUses only fallback-approved tools","x":1650,"y":710,"width":290,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"d573f9b63060df8b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Aug 13 discussion points\n\n1. Number representation in the response\n\t1. instead of too much text need some quick glance characters like numbers",
